SUMMARY:Michael - the life and legacy + Pre-Dinner (Bay Station confirmed)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: Regular 7:10pm show confirmed at C
 ineplex Varsity.**\n\nOn **Friday April 24th\,** let's see **Michael\,** *
 *the cinematic portrayal of the life and legacy of one of the most influen
 tial artists the world has ever known**. The film tells the story of Micha
 el Jackson’s life beyond the music\, tracing his journey from the discov
 ery of his extraordinary talent as the lead of the Jackson Five\, to the v
 isionary artist whose creative ambition fueled a relentless pursuit to bec
 ome the biggest entertainer in the world. Highlighting both his life off-s
 tage and some of the most iconic performances from his early solo career\,
  the film gives audiences a front-row seat to Michael Jackson as never bef
 ore. This is where his story begins.. **My seat is K21. Purchase your tick
 ets for Michael on Friday April 24th at the regular 7:10pm show at Cineple
 x Varsity.**\n\n**COST**\n$15.70 or CineClub $9.99 + fees\n\n**SIGNING UP*
 *\n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes confirming Yes/No to food/drinks after**\n* **[Pu
 rchase](https://www.cineplex.com/movie/michael-2026?ic=cpx_hp-moviegrid-8)
 ** **your own ticket by selecting Advance Tickets\, Cineplex Varsity\, Fri
 day April 24th\, Regular Show at 7:10pm**\n* You can also meet the group a
 t the meetup time with your ticket in hand\n* RSVPs close the day prior\n\
 n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for dinner at: 5:30pm at Scaccia\, Manulife Ce
 ntre\, 55 Bloor St. W.\, Basement Level**\n\n**Meet me for the movie at: 7
 pm in front of Auditorium 1 inside Cineplex Varsity in Manulife Centre at 
 55 Bloor St. W. after scanning your ticket**\n\n**Show starts**: 7:10pm\n\
 nLength: 2 hours 10 minutes\n\nAfter: meet me outside Auditorium 1 to head
  out and chat about the movie\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in th
 e event after.
